```

This copies the ENTIRE `union expr_constant` struct, including the uninitialized `mask` field, into the parsing result. So far this is just a copy of uninitialized data.

Then, when this gets to `make_cmp__`:
```c
bitwise_copy(&c->value, sizeof c->value, 0,
